  "gear": "10 cones, tape or spray paint for the halfway marks",
  "worksAsStation": false,
  "description": "Two lines of cones run the length of the ice, one line of skaters at each end. Skate forward past a cone, turn to skating backward at a mark halfway to the next cone, then turn forward again at that cone. Repeat to the end of the course.",
